{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become the best K-pop producer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the CEO and producer of your new agency, you decide to take Mina under your wing. Bring out her potential and guide her as she blooms into a legendary idol.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Activities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training \u2013 Acquire the skills required to become an idol. Decide what specialty you want her to follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part-time job \u2013 Sometimes, she may need other skills to make it out there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax \u2013 When you're tired of studies and work, give yourself a well-deserved break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Business</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try different types of collaboration projects. You'll have many opportunities to make loads of cash and boost your popularity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775280/extras/19b97311d6a6dd3481c538c652a6a38b.avif?t=1753374832\" width=650 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with friends and build relationships. Enjoy various experiences and activities with company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775280/extras/29e817fe85c8a0eb6651a79c0930209f.avif?t=1753374832\" width=1500 height=1440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clothing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect outfits and refine your fashion style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775280/extras/a203e9f371bb52cb4d3b7e9685cedbe2.avif?t=1753374832\" width=1500 height=1440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tournaments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain more fans by participating in various competitions. One win could dramatically change Mina's future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775280/extras/b80f69c258ac7664031c4c9b6cbac35c.avif?t=1753374832\" width=650 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mina's future is in your hands. Discover what the future holds as you reach one of many endings.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3775280?t=1753374832","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3775280?t=1753374832","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775280/31ad973899645ad4b4a6cf3317139eefd64ad108/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753374832","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775280/31ad973899645ad4b4a6cf3317139eefd64ad108/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753374832","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become the best K-pop producer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the CEO and producer of your new agency, you decide to take Mina under your wing. Bring out her potential and guide her as she blooms into a legendary idol.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Activities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training \u2013 Acquire the skills required to become an idol. Decide what specialty you want her to follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part-time job \u2013 Sometimes, she may need other skills to make it out there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax \u